"If \"Show all icons when the microphone or camera turns on\" is on, a camera or microphone that turns on while you present pauses hiding once, so macOS can show which app uses it. Nothing is hidden meanwhile, sensitive apps included. Hiding resumes when you click Hide again or collapse the bar, or when the camera and microphone turn off. A camera or microphone already on when you start does not pause it. With the switch off, hiding never pauses." = "如果开启了 \"麦克风或摄像头开启时显示所有图标\"，则在您演示期间开启的摄像头或麦克风会让隐藏暂停一次，以便 macOS 显示是哪个 App 在使用。在此期间不会隐藏任何内容，包括敏感 App。当您点按“再次隐藏”或折叠栏，或摄像头和麦克风关闭时，隐藏会恢复。开始时已开启的摄像头或麦克风不会使其暂停。关闭该开关后，隐藏永不暂停。";
"Stop it from the Presenting capsule, the shortcut, or the right-click menu. An automatic start also ends when mirroring stops." = "可通过“演示中”胶囊、快捷键或右键菜单停止。自动启动的演示也会在镜像停止时结束。";
"Edit..." = "编辑...";
"None" = "无";
"Choose the apps that stay hidden while presenting, even when you click the arrow, except while hiding is paused for the camera or microphone." = "选取演示期间保持隐藏的 App，即使点按箭头也是如此，但因摄像头或麦克风而暂停隐藏时除外。";
"Apps with a menu bar icon appear here once Hidden Bar has seen them." = "Hidden Bar 发现菜单栏中有图标的 App 后，它们会显示在这里。";
"Right-click on the arrow" = "右键点按箭头";
"Show menu" = "显示菜单";
"Show always-hidden icons" = "显示持续隐藏的图标";
"Option-right-click the arrow to open the menu." = "按住 Option 右键点按箭头即可打开菜单。";
"Hidden Bar from the App Store is running. Quit it and switch to this version?" = "App Store 版 Hidden Bar 正在运行。要退出它并切换到此版本吗？";
"Only one Hidden Bar can run at a time. The App Store version stays installed until you choose otherwise." = "同一时间只能运行一个 Hidden Bar。在您另作选择之前，App Store 版会保持安装。";
"Hidden Bar %@ is running. Quit it and switch to this version?" = "Hidden Bar %@ 正在运行。要退出它并切换到此版本吗？";
"Only one Hidden Bar can run at a time. The older version stays where it is until you choose otherwise." = "同一时间只能运行一个 Hidden Bar。在您另作选择之前，旧版本会保留在原处。";
"Quit and Switch" = "退出并切换";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Import your settings from the App Store version?" = "要从 App Store 版导入您的设置吗？";
"Hidden Bar from the App Store keeps its settings in a separate place. Import them so this version starts the way you set it up." = "App Store 版 Hidden Bar 将设置保存在另一个位置。导入后，此版本将以您设置好的方式启动。";
"Import" = "导入";
"Not now" = "暂不";
"Move the App Store copy to the Trash?" = "要将 App Store 版副本移到废纸篓吗？";
"The App Store version of Hidden Bar is still installed:\n%@\nYou can restore it from the Trash later." = "App Store 版 Hidden Bar 仍然安装着：\n%@\n您之后可以从废纸篓中将其恢复。";
"Move to Trash" = "移到废纸篓";
"Hidden Bar could not move the App Store copy to the Trash" = "Hidden Bar 无法将 App Store 版副本移到废纸篓";
"Drag it to the Trash in Finder instead:\n%@" = "请改为在 Finder 中将其拖到废纸篓：\n%@";
"The App Store copy is in /Applications. Quit Hidden Bar, move /Applications/Hidden Bar.app to the Trash, drag this copy into Applications, then open it from there." = "App Store 版副本位于 /Applications。请退出 Hidden Bar，将 /Applications/Hidden Bar.app 移到废纸篓，把此副本拖到“应用程序”文件夹，然后从那里打开。";
"This account can't add apps to /Applications. Ask an administrator to drag Hidden Bar into /Applications, then open it from there." = "此账户无法向 /Applications 添加 App。请让管理员将 Hidden Bar 拖到 /Applications，然后从那里打开。";
"Hidden Bar is running from outside Applications. The copy already in Applications goes to the Trash, then Hidden Bar relaunches from there." = "Hidden Bar 正在“应用程序”文件夹之外运行。“应用程序”中已有的副本会被移到废纸篓，然后 Hidden Bar 将从那里重新启动。";
"Hidden Bar is running from outside Applications. Move it there so it keeps working after you empty Downloads, then relaunch." = "Hidden Bar 正在“应用程序”文件夹之外运行。请将其移到“应用程序”，这样清空“下载”后它仍能正常使用，然后重新启动。";
"Move Hidden Bar to the Applications folder?" = "要将 Hidden Bar 移到“应用程序”文件夹吗？";
"Move to Applications" = "移到“应用程序”";
"Hidden Bar can hide icons only from /Applications" = "Hidden Bar 只能在 /Applications 中隐藏图标";
"a temporary folder" = "临时文件夹";
"Hidden Bar cannot hide icons on macOS 27" = "Hidden Bar 无法在 macOS 27 上隐藏图标";
"macOS 27 no longer lets App Store apps hide menu-bar icons. Hidden Bar from github.com/consolelabs/hidden (free, open source) works on macOS 27." = "macOS 27 不再允许 App Store 应用隐藏菜单栏图标。github.com/consolelabs/hidden 上的 Hidden Bar（免费、开源）可在 macOS 27 上使用。";
"Open github.com/consolelabs/hidden" = "打开 github.com/consolelabs/hidden";
"Don't show again" = "不再显示";
"Hidden Bar on macOS 27" = "macOS 27 上的 Hidden Bar";
"macOS 27: get the working version..." = "macOS 27：获取可用版本...";
"Or install it with Homebrew:" = "或使用 Homebrew 安装：";
"Quit this App Store version and move it to the Trash first. Homebrew does not install over it." = "请先退出此 App Store 版并将其移到废纸篓。Homebrew 不能覆盖安装。";
"Hiding is paused" = "已暂停隐藏";
"macOS hides these icons whatever Hidden Bar allows: %@. They sit right of the arrow, so the pause switch in Advanced keeps everything visible while they are there." = "无论 Hidden Bar 是否允许，macOS 都会隐藏这些图标：%@。它们位于箭头右侧，因此只要它们仍在那里，“高级”中的暂停开关就会让所有图标保持可见。";
"icons with no name" = "没有名称的图标";
"Nothing to hide" = "没有可隐藏的内容";
"Every icon is right of the arrow, so there is nothing to hide. Hold Command and drag the arrow to the right of the icons you want to hide." = "所有图标都在箭头右侧，因此没有可隐藏的内容。按住 Command 并将箭头拖到要隐藏的图标右侧。";
